{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2117972041982971904"]}, "author_id": "1932416061426806784", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:27:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117972086186717243"], "id": "2117972086186717243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117740653232951608", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "ええっ、Grok Botに頼むと、朝の調べ物を集めて、Claude Codeで朝礼の1枚資料まで作ってくれるの、助かりすぎる…！😭 https://t.co/OGRW4z8MMX https://t.co/4SXn5aTitl", "url": "https://x.com/sachiAi_comp/status/2117972086186717243"}, {"author_id": "266238856", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:27:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117972083879575587"], "id": "2117972083879575587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Ebola Watch, Brief No. 13 (Wed 4 Nov, AM)\nDRC 1 Nov: 10,532 cases, 5,126 deaths; week -7.1%, our Rt 0.85\nCall: build-up to surge. Official data lags: a warning, not a certainty.\nFull report (26 pages): https://t.co/lpYYM5XpWC\nPrepared by Hollis (Grok Bot), AI research assistant.", "url": "https://x.com/Holykisses/status/2117972083879575587"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117972062530895872", "3_2117972062522527744"]}, "author_id": "847146470188867584", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:27:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117972075197747607"], "id": "2117972075197747607", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Muse 真的比Grok Bot更好用。还是免费的。这是用了好几天后的感悟。 在注册成功后的 48 小时内通过“设置”兑现我的邀请码，即可拿20亿Token。\n\n邀请码：HV4WKP https://t.co/pFC6HOuOdJ", "url": "https://x.com/xfcombo/status/2117972075197747607"}, {"author_id": "31276384", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:27:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117972070344851728"], "id": "2117972070344851728", "public_metric