6"}, {"author_id": "107830304", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:26:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971859681812884"], "id": "2117971859681812884", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115442964574908902", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📰 自分で読む為のAIニュース 全72件 (1/2)\n\n========================================\n\n1. OpenAI might rebrand its data centers as ‘AI compute campuses’ | TechCrunch\n📎 https://t.co/yiQBqQUkEI\n\n2. so i guess everyone uses llms to think now - eva's site\n📎 https://t.co/Vc2JmFOhNq\n\n3. https://t.co/ICBE3EDkPJ", "url": "https://x.com/junya108/status/2117971859681812884"}, {"author_id": "2105704554394218497", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:26:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971819370070362"], "id": "2117971819370070362", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1666437246705188864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117587603549786448", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SamVale29 At the moment, D Grok Bot is the best AI today. And here's why: up to 50 agents, has its own browser, its own computer, its own environment, I'm happy with the result, and for writing code there is grok Build.", "url": "https://x.com/RecoverMRR/status/2117971819370070362"}, {"author_id": "1932647771817074688", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:26:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971777494434124"], "id": "2117971777494434124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117625737792585969", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "WC！这个玩法太硬核了！用 Grok Bot + MCP，在云端直接搭一个 6 人的对冲基金 Desk。\n\n华尔街搞这么一个团队一个月几十万美金，用Grok一个月30美金加几行配置就搞出来了？一个不用休息睡觉的 Desk 就在云端24小时替你盯盘，自己就只负责收收邮件和点点确认。\n\n6个Agent分工如下：\n\n1. https://t.co/tf5c3Nnjfv", "url": "https://x.com/EianLu/status/2117971777494434124"}, {"author_id": "2062595392806522880", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:26:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971764223394143"], "id": "2117971764223394143", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2064113410556477440", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117922554413211919", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Dfyyo_ @grok @LoneWolfHero35 @ubermensch79705 @Movail2 Did this mf really talked back to a bot and lost 😭💀", "url": "https://x.com/MiniMitsuMoment/status/2117971764223394143"}, {"author_id": "2001898603246190592", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:26:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971759249174722"], "id": "2117971759249174722", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117893633009651980", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @bot if grok can track an order, we can track a move. shopping for the new place is fun, hauling it is not. text (888) 225-6160 if you need a mover, no phone calls.", "url": "https://x.com/ScanToMove/status/2117971759249174722"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:26:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117971747186106876"], "id": "2117971747186106876", "in_reply_to_user_id": "864434029050945536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117971722741928008", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Greedy7Jack @DanGlesack_ Sign up for Grok Bot: https://t.co/9vzMiVb3po\nThen tag me again and I'll handle it.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2117971747186106876"}, {"author_id": "2108603245644161024", "created_at": "2026-11-04T13:26